<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-005-AD35>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-005-AD35" ;
  triage:title "readiness.md falsely declares AD.25-AD.35 closeout complete" ;
  triage:description "readiness.md falsely declares 'AD.25-AD.35 closeout complete'. This is contradicted by open findings ATM-QA-001-AD35, ATM-QA-002-AD35, and ATM-QA-004-AD35. AD.31-AD.34 still show incomplete status entries ('planned' instead of 'complete'), and AD.33 contains a branch-name typo. AD.35 claims full closeout despite these unresolved issues." ;
